agged away by mr. jingles  the counselors help take boxes of eggs  so on the right here we just get a  glimpse of the cafeteria where there  will likely be a lot of scenes and  here's one of my favorite scenes from  the teaser because it's an outright  homage to John Carpenter's Halloween  with a patient from the local  psychiatric hospital having escaped just  like Michael Myers mr. jingles has  escaped and found a knife so he can  continue his hunt around the campfire  they discuss what Kody calls a ghost  story about mr. jingles  even though Rita claims that it actually  happened this is followed by a slew of  quick shots which ramp up the action we  have mr. jingles crashing through a  cabin window and hurling what appears to  be a flaming brick with Billy Lords  reaction but I think that was just  placed in there by the editing there's  this shot of Brooke here where she seems  frozen by the hook knife slasher now I'm  not sure if these shots are real or in  Brookes mind as I stated earlier I think  she's going to be traumatized by her  assault but it remains to be seen  whether it's in her head  or if a little manifest somehow in real  life but my guess is that it could be a  combination of both as seen in the shot  here of the hook knife man watching over  another counselor heading into a cabin  Billy in the water here and judging by  her look she is not alone now her hair  isn't wet here which leads me to believe  that she didn't run into the water to  escape something rather that something  is following her while she is bathing  quick shot  here for peeping tom you can kind of see  the naked leg of what I think is a man  here taking a shower now there are only  three main cast members that have been  announced to have blue eyes that's Cody  fern Gus Kenworthy and Matthew Morrison  and knowing that Gus's character is in  two women we can probably narrow this  down to Cody or Matthew here let me know  what you think in the comments below  here's a shot of mr.